    "body": "This branch now has a merge of `main` (head `79316a5dc`). The PR is a draft again until the delta review is done.\n\nThree files have hand edits:\n\n- `crates/app/src/operation/wire_op.rs`: the merge keeps `one_condition` and the skims door from `main` (issue 538). `WireCondition` gets the `taper_angle` field of this branch. `generate_wire` runs the skims refusal first, then `corner_rule`.\n- `crates/app/src/posting_wire.rs`: the merge keeps `angle_lean` (issue 1164) and `announce_skims` (issue 538).\n- `crates/app/tests/wire_taper_angle.rs`: the fixture states the new `skims` field as empty.\n\nLocal results on the merged tree, Windows, debug:\n\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --tests -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- The app suites `wire_*`, `sodick_wire_post`, `mcp_wire_contour`, `edm_*`, `feature_pick_wire`: all pass.\n- `camcraft-post` suites `script_wire_iso` and `script_sodick_wire`: pass.\n- `camcraft-motion` tests with `wire` in the name: pass.\n\nNot exercised: the full gate, and a real wire EDM control.\n\nTwo files are now longer than 400 lines: `wire_op.rs` (443) and `posting_wire.rs` (421). A follow-up split is necessary.\n\nThe review of `b1c287a0a` does not cover the hand edits. A delta review of the remerge diff is necessary before the merge.\n",
